## Must-fix (ranked)

1. **NMF-1** — §11.5 per-arm registered primary replay: "F/L 420, P/PA 420" → **F/L 360, P/PA 480** (total 1,680 unchanged; same error propagates into `t_primary_replay_arm` "registered 420"). Text-only arithmetic correction, not a threshold change.
2. **NMF-2** — Phase-7 record domain inconsistency: §9.6.1 says `memory_kind ∈ {real,donor}`, §12.2 says `{control,real}`, and the golden supplemental (verified: `38e5e2fb…f6695`) actually contains a `donor` record. Canonical schema must admit `{control,real,donor}` with phase-5 (donor_sort=-1) vs phase-7 (donor_sort 0..4) domains and the degenerate variant axis stated.
3. **NMF-3** — §13.4 omits the supplemental golden from hash/replay tests (one line).
4. **NMF-4** — `p1_usage.json` malformed/missing-field handling (NA vs false) unstated (one line).
5. **NMF-5** — D0 "≤4 configs" undefined (one line).

