- **Max compute**: nothing runs under this round except post-freeze D0 (≤15 min). Registered caps restated, not altered: 12 units / 1,200 updates / 120 min wall / 6 threads / CPU-only / no retry; T_proj ≤96 min gate; prospective max 1,204 updates / 155 min.
